{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06617","headline":"同房宪部应旋 · 储光羲","name":"同房宪部应旋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衡山法王子，慧见息诸苦。\n落发自南州，燕居在西土。\n养正不因晦，得中宁患旅。\n旷然长虚闲，即理寄行补。\n四句了自性，一音亦非取。\n橘柚故园枝，随人植庭户。\n我地少安住，念天时啓处。\n宪卿文昌归，愉悦来晤语。\n车骑践香草，仆人沐花雨。\n长风散繁云，万里静天宇。\n起灭信易觉，清真知有所。\n逍遥高殿阴，六月无炎暑。\n微言发新偈，粲粲如悬圃。\n直心视惠光，在此大法鼓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}